---
import ServiceLogistics from "./ServiceLogistics.astro";
---
<!-- ====================================================
PANEL: SERVICES
==================================================== -->
<div id="panel-services" class="panel" aria-hidden="false">
<div class="panel-inner">
<p class="sub-eyebrow">Built for working kitchens and serious tools.</p>
<h2 class="sub-headline-cyan text-4xl lg:text-5xl mb-3">Services</h2>
<p class="sub-body mb-10 max-w-2xl text-sm">Every edge is approached through geometry, steel preservation, and real-world kitchen performance. The goal is not to grind every knife the same way. It is to understand what the tool is, what it does, and what it needs to do better.</p>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
<div class="service-tile">
<div class="service-tile-icon">Edge</div>
<div class="service-tile-title">Knife Sharpening</div>
<div class="service-tile-body">Precision sharpening for chef knives, slicers, utility knives, paring knives, and specialty blades. Edges are matched to the tool, the steel, and the way the knife is used.</div>
<div class="price-tag">From $10/knife</div>
</div>
<div class="service-tile">
<div class="service-tile-icon">Repair</div>
<div class="service-tile-title">Repair &amp; Restoration</div>
<div class="service-tile-body">Chip repair, tip repair, thinning, reprofiling, rust cleanup, and corrective work for knives that need more than a quick pass on a belt.</div>
<div class="price-tag">By assessment</div>
</div>
<div class="service-tile">
<div class="service-tile-icon">Kitchen</div>
<div class="service-tile-title">Restaurant &amp; Hotel Programs</div>
<div class="service-tile-body">Scheduled edge-care programs for kitchens that need consistency, accountability, and tools ready for service.</div>
<div class="price-tag">Custom quote</div>
</div>
<div class="service-tile">
<div class="service-tile-icon">Custom</div>
<div class="service-tile-title">Specialty Modifications</div>
<div class="service-tile-body">Functional adjustments for tools that need to perform differently, including practical conversions, shape changes, and task-specific edge work.</div>
<div class="price-tag">By assessment</div>
</div>
</div>

<ServiceLogistics mode="overview" />

<section class="mb-12 pt-2" aria-labelledby="service-paths-heading">
<p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400/70 font-bold mb-2">Explore Service Pages</p>
<h3 id="service-paths-heading" class="text-white/82 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide mb-5">Choose the right edge-care path</h3>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
<a href="/knife-sharpening-miami/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Knife Sharpening in Miami</div><div class="service-tile-body">Professional edge care for Japanese, Western, serrated, and everyday kitchen knives.</div></a>
<a href="/restaurant-knife-sharpening-miami/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Restaurant Knife Sharpening</div><div class="service-tile-body">Recurring fleet sharpening and repair for restaurants, hotels, and commercial kitchens.</div></a>
<a href="/sharp-after-dark/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Sharp After Dark</div><div class="service-tile-body">After-hours collection and return designed around service and prep schedules.</div></a>
<a href="/japanese-knife-sharpening-miami/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Japanese Knife Sharpening</div><div class="service-tile-body">Careful sharpening for premium steels, single-bevel knives, and geometry-sensitive blades.</div></a>
<a href="/knife-repair-restoration-miami/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Knife Repair &amp; Restoration</div><div class="service-tile-body">Assessment and correction for chips, broken tips, rust, wear, and damaged profiles.</div></a>
<a href="/steak-knife-sharpening-miami-restaurants/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Steak Knife Sharpening</div><div class="service-tile-body">Batch and recurring dining-room fleet care for restaurants, steakhouses, and hotels.</div></a>
<a href="/miami-knife-club/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Miami Knife Club</div><div class="service-tile-body">Recurring premium edge care for serious home cooks and private chefs.</div></a>
<a href="/send-photos/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Send Knife Photos</div><div class="service-tile-body">Share clear photos for repair, restoration, unusual knives, or condition review.</div></a>
<a href="/book/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Book Service</div><div class="service-tile-body">Choose restaurant, home-kitchen, or special-request service and start scheduling.</div></a>
</div>
</section>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
<div>
<p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-white/22 font-bold mb-4">&Agrave; la Carte</p>
<div class="space-y-0">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Single Knife Sharpening</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Shop drop-off &middot; Same-day or quick turnaround when available</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">$10/knife</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Pickup &amp; Return</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Free within 10 miles for orders of 10+ knives</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">Free / $1 per mile</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Knife Exchange Program</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Trade dull knives for sharp refurbished ones &middot; Shipping included</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">$99</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-white/22 font-bold mb-4">Workshops</p>
<div class="space-y-0">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Knife Skills Intensive</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">4 weeks &middot; Weekly 2-hour sessions &middot; Sharpening instruction</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">$399</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Corporate Culinary Experience</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Half-day &middot; Up to 15 participants &middot; Sharpening demo + meal</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">From $1,200</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-5 border-t border-white/5">
<a href="/book/" class="panel-cta-btn panel-cta-cyan">Book Service</a>
<a href="/send-photos/" class="panel-cta-btn panel-cta-ghost">Send Photos &rarr;</a>
</div>
</div>
</div><!-- /panel-services -->